{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# imgcache — Store Image\nMultipart upload: `client.store(url, file_bytes, client_name, …)` → `POST /cache`\nPerceptual hashing is computed server-side.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 100
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**START**\nScraper has image bytes to cache",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -60,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[Scraper]**\nCalls `client.store(url, file_bytes, client_name, bucket=\"default\", filename=…, prefix=…)`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 70,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[ImgCacheClient — Python lib]**\nComputes `content_hash = blake3(file_bytes).hexdigest()` locally",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[ImgCacheClient]**\n`POST /cache` as multipart form-data:\nFields: `{ url, client_name, bucket, content_hash, [prefix] }`\nFile part: raw image bytes (filename defaults to `\"image\"` if not provided)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 110
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[imgcache service]**\nReceives multipart request, validates fields",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 70
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[imgcache service]**\nComputes perceptual hash (phash) from the image bytes server-side\n(used for similarity search via Hamming distance)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[imgcache service]**\nWrites image bytes to local file storage (path keyed by bucket + content_hash)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[imgcache service → PostgreSQL]**\nInserts cache entry row:\n`url, content_hash, phash, bucket, client_name, stored_at, file_path, [prefix]`",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 880,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**[imgcache service]**\nReturns `201 Created` with cache entry metadata JSON\n(includes `hash`, `phash`, `url`, `bucket`, `stored_at`, `file_path`)",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1020,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 90
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**END**\n`client.store()` returns the metadata dict to the Scraper",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1160,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
